  title: The four Vedas
  text: The four Vedas are the Rigveda of hymns, the Samaveda of melodies for chanting, the Yajurveda of sacrificial formulas, and the Atharvaveda of spells, charms and everyday concerns. The tradition of Vedic chanting is recognised by UNESCO as intangible heritage.
